{"seq":4,"slug":"subscription-pricing-billing","title":"订阅、定价与计费","stage":"DONE","category":"indie-app-shipping","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing","rating":{"composite":3.68,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 订阅、定价与计费 简介\n\n定价直接决定独立产品能否赚到可持续的钱，是发布之外最该认真对待的商业决策。本 hub 面向要给 app 设计变现的独立开发者，从定价模型（买断 vs 订阅、免费增值 vs 免费试用、用量与分层）讲起，覆盖付费墙与转化（付费墙设计、免费试用机制、方案结构与锚定）、计费基础设施（Stripe 与 Web 计费、IAP 与 RevenueCat、平台抽成与支付规则），以及定价的演进（价格实验、涨价、流失感知定价）。贯穿全篇的实操主线是：让定价模型匹配产品创造价值的方式、价值定价而非成本定价且宁高勿低、把计费这件高风险的事交给成熟服务、并把定价当作持续优化的变量——降低流失（尤其用催缴挽回非自愿流失、主推年付）与适时涨价，是订阅生意可持续的关键。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pricing-models","title":"Pricing Models","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/pricing-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"one-time-vs-subscription","title":"一次性买断与订阅","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/pricing-models/one-time-vs-subscription"},{"seq":2,"slug":"freemium-and-free-trial","title":"免费增值与免费试用","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/pricing-models/freemium-and-free-trial"},{"seq":3,"slug":"usage-and-tiered-pricing","title":"用量计费与分层定价","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/pricing-models/usage-and-tiered-pricing"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"paywall-and-conversion","title":"Paywall And Conversion","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/paywall-and-conversion","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"paywall-design","title":"付费墙设计","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/paywall-and-conversion/paywall-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"free-trial-mechanics","title":"免费试用的机制","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/paywall-and-conversion/free-trial-mechanics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"plan-structure-and-anchoring","title":"方案结构与锚定","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/paywall-and-conversion/plan-structure-and-anchoring"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"billing-infrastructure","title":"Billing Infrastructure","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/billing-infrastructure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stripe-and-web-billing","title":"Stripe 与 Web 计费","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/billing-infrastructure/stripe-and-web-billing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"iap-and-revenuecat","title":"应用内购与 RevenueCat","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/billing-infrastructure/iap-and-revenuecat"},{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-cut-and-payment-rules","title":"平台抽成与支付规则","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/billing-infrastructure/platform-cut-and-payment-rules"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"pricing-over-time","title":"Pricing Over Time","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/pricing-over-time","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"price-experiments","title":"价格实验","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/pricing-over-time/price-experiments"},{"seq":2,"slug":"raising-prices","title":"涨价","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/pricing-over-time/raising-prices"},{"seq":3,"slug":"churn-aware-pricing","title":"流失感知定价","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/subscription-pricing-billing/pricing-over-time/churn-aware-pricing"}]}]}